 "phrases": [
  {
   "text": "In 1932,",
   "s": 0.0,
   "e": 1.388
  },
  {
   "text": "the Australian army went to war with a bird.",
   "s": 1.695,
   "e": 4.338
  },
  {
   "text": "And lost.",
   "s": 4.874,
   "e": 5.658
  },
  {
   "text": "Western Australia.",
   "s": 6.302,
   "e": 7.3
  },
  {
   "text": "Thousands of war veterans were farming wheat on dry,",
   "s": 7.854,
   "e": 10.927
  },
  {
   "text": "difficult land.",
   "s": 11.066,
   "e": 11.883
  },
  {
   "text": "Then about twenty thousand hungry emus marched in and started wrecking the crops.",
   "s": 12.336,
   "e": 17.641
  },
  {
   "text": "The farmers begged for help.",
   "s": 18.02,
   "e": 19.61
  },
  {
   "text": "So the government sent a major,",
   "s": 19.995,
   "e": 22.031
  },
  {
   "text": "two soldiers,",
   "s": 22.406,
   "e": 23.191
  },
  {
   "text": "two machine guns,",
   "s": 23.404,
   "e": 24.291
  },
  {
   "text": "and ten thousand bullets.",
   "s": 24.431,
   "e": 26.035
  },
  {
   "text": "The plan was simple:",
   "s": 26.424,
   "e": 27.268
  },
  {
   "text": "finish it in days.",
   "s": 27.723,
   "e": 29.019
  },
  {
   "text": "But the moment the guns opened fire,",
   "s": 29.467,
   "e": 31.22
  },
  {
   "text": "the emus scattered.",
   "s": 31.404,
   "e": 32.515
  },
  {
   "text": "They split into small groups and vanished into the bush.",
   "s": 32.922,
   "e": 35.646
  },
  {
   "text": "The soldiers chased them.",
   "s": 36.017,
   "e": 37.118
  },
  {
   "text": "The birds were faster.",
   "s": 37.614,
   "e": 38.834
  },
  {
   "text": "So the major mounted a gun on a truck.",
   "s": 39.226,
   "e": 41.709
  },
  {
   "text": "But the ground was so bumpy,",
   "s": 42.096,
   "e": 43.686
  },
  {
   "text": "nobody could aim.",
   "s": 43.815,
   "e": 44.747
  },
  {
   "text": "And the truck couldn't keep up anyway.",
   "s": 45.128,
   "e": 46.667
  },
  {
   "text": "Weeks passed.",
   "s": 47.114,
   "e": 48.023
  },
  {
   "text": "Newspapers started laughing.",
   "s": 48.392,
   "e": 49.843
  },
  {
   "text": "Politicians started asking questions.",
   "s": 50.202,
   "e": 52.215
  },
  {
   "text": "Finally,",
   "s": 52.63,
   "e": 53.204
  },
  {
   "text": "the army packed up and quietly went home.",
   "s": 53.337,
   "e": 55.649
  },
  {
   "text": "Even the major admitted he was impressed.",
   "s": 56.126,
   "e": 58.096
  },
  {
   "text": "Final score:",
   "s": 58.499,
   "e": 59.24
  },
  {
   "text": "the army,",
   "s": 59.643,
   "e": 60.202
  },
  {
   "text": "zero.",
   "s": 60.405,
   "e": 60.877
  },
  {
   "text": "The emus,",
   "s": 61.297,
   "e": 61.978
  },
  {
   "text": "undefeated.",
   "s": 62.294,
   "e": 62.994
  }
 ]
